Package: infiltrator-os-plymouth-theme
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Infiltrator Projects <noreply@infiltrator-projects.invalid>
Depends: plymouth, apt, wget, ca-certificates, bash
Description: Infiltrator OS boot branding and native System Monitor integration
 Installs the canonical Infiltrator OS Plymouth splash for Debian and
 Linux Mint derived systems, selects it as the active theme, rebuilds
 initramfs, and replaces distribution System Monitor packages with the
 latest Infiltrator System Monitor built aggressively for the local CPU.
